<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>EP Education RSVP</title></head><body style="margin:0;background:#f4f7f4;color:#183228;font:16px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif"><table role="presentation" style="max-width:640px;width:100%;margin:auto;background:#fff;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td><img src="{{ url('/education-rsvp/assets/conversation-email.jpg') }}" alt="A conversation about education opportunities" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:32px"><img src="{{ url('/education-landing/ep-logo.png') }}" alt="EP Education" width="76"><h1 style="font-size:28px;line-height:1.25">{{ $notice === 'cancelled' ? 'Your visit has been cancelled' : (str_starts_with($notice, 'reminder') ? 'Your Education visit is coming up' : ($notice === 'schedule' ? 'Your schedule is confirmed' : 'Your RSVP is received')) }}</h1><p>Hello {{ $rsvp->full_name }},</p><p>Thank you for confirming your attendance at our Education event.</p><p><strong>{{ $rsvp->visit->school }}</strong><br>{{ $rsvp->visit->activity }}<br>{{ $rsvp->visit->summary() }}@if($rsvp->visit->schedule_confirmed && $rsvp->visit->location)<br>{{ $rsvp->visit->location }}@endif</p>@if(!$rsvp->visit->schedule_confirmed && $rsvp->visit->status !== 'cancelled')<p>We are finalizing the schedule. We will email the confirmed details after you verify your email.</p>@endif @if(!$rsvp->verified_at)<p><a href="{{ URL::temporarySignedRoute('education.rsvp.verify', now()->addDays(30), ['rsvp' => $rsvp->public_id]) }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;background:#267443;color:#fff;text-decoration:none">Verify my RSVP email</a></p><p>This confirms your email for reminders and later contact matching. Your RSVP is already saved.</p>@endif<p>This is an RSVP, not a programme application. If you later register with matching verified contact details, your RSVP can appear in your applicant journey.</p><p><a href="{{ url('/education-journey') }}">Visit website</a> · <a href="mailto:{{ config('services.contact.reply_to') ?: config('services.contact.email') ?: 'hello@epathways.ph' }}">Contact Education</a> · <a href="{{ url('/login') }}">Applicant login</a></p><p style="font-size:13px">You chose to RSVP for this school visit or meeting. Reply to this email to correct or cancel your RSVP.</p></td></tr></table></body></html>
